  navigation, library search) keep their recorded places.
- Flathub submission follows the word-count lane, in a screenshot
  session with Brandon; the metainfo screenshot slots and a full
  offline flatpak-builder re-verification ride that session.
- Phase 6e hands-on confirmation pass (Brandon, keyboard in hand).
- Estimate-accuracy card: recorded as the next Tier A candidate.
- Declined and recorded (do not re-raise): export PNG/CSV,
  dragon-themer integration / custom palettes, reading goals.
- README screenshot refresh (predates v2.5.0) and the social-preview
  upload ride the next visual session.
- Keyboard sidebar resize stays optional (roadmap 6e box).
